### Diagnostico do modelo
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/diagnostico/modelo
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent

### Predicao valida - episodio de alto desempenho
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "min_score": 1548.0,
  "sum_score": 3107.6,
  "size_bytes": 8243598,
  "hora": 9
}

